{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>The Mosquito Gang</strong>, you\u2019ll take on the role of one of four elite, highly-trained mosquitoes in a desperate war against the greatest threat insectkind has ever faced: a repellent so powerful, so effective, it could wipe out the bug bloodline forever. With wings sharp as blades and bloodlust in your hearts, you must infiltrate human territory, drain their life force, evolve mid-battle, and extract before the repellent goes live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>OR...</strong> become the <strong>Human</strong> \u2014 humanity\u2019s last line of defense. Armed with an ever-growing arsenal of weapons and gadgets, it\u2019s your job to swat, spray, and stomp your way to victory and stop the swarm for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Asymmetric 1vs4 Multiplayer Mayhem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 human. 4 mosquitoes. Countless screams, swats, and near-death experiences. Tons of fun.  Pick side you are on!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/FireStarter.gif?t=1751028501\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rogue-lite Evolution with Over-the-Top Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your ideal insect mid-match. Spend blood to gain powers like:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Invisibility</strong> \u2013 For those dramatic entrances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Teleportation</strong> \u2013 Mosquitoes can teleport, don\u2019t question it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Party Heal</strong> \u2013 Everyone needs healing, even bugs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Shield, speed boosts, bite upgrades, and way too many passive buffs</strong></p></li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/Shield.gif?t=1751028501\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Humaninties Only Hope</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete chores (yes, chores), earn cash, and buy weapons ranging from slightly inconvenient to wildly illegal <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/HumanRocketLauncher.gif?t=1751028501\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Three Deadly Maps, One Glorious War</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>The Scientist\u2019s House</strong> \u2013 Smells like home and desinfection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Toxor Labs</strong> \u2013 High-tech facility. Bugs here are test subjects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Flagship</strong> \u2013 Cocktails, Party, and no bugs invited</p></li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/Locations.gif?t=1751028501\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stylish Cosmetics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dress your mosquito or human according to the latest fashion. The fashion stakes have never been higher<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811100/extras/Cosmetics.gif?t=1751028501\" /></div></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Just Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2811100/d011a0e0eda677caee947e16ea9adfe10ff7fc57.jpg"},{"name":"Certified Sucker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2811100/dee3d848e8708d4fdc90c3ce026137a49bf4900e.jpg"},{"name":"Slap Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a